  "description": "“Michael, don’t you want to sleep with me?”   \n“…You’re driving me crazy.”\n\nMichael, my childhood friend who has hovered around me, Catherine, since we were young, acting so possessive that I couldn't tell if he was a knight or a bodyguard.\n\nUsing the excuse of my frail health, he wouldn’t let anyone so much as lay a finger on me. I decided to make the most audacious proposal to him.\n\nThe large hands of the man who had always pushed me away began to tremble slightly.\n\nBehind the mask of a 'childhood friend' that had defined his life, a beast-like thirst finally revealed itself.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297089925), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14606441), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000080894), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260593), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70248111), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H050034818), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H050034818), Toon365, ZzangComic, [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=f4nq), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=uoxp), [Aladin](https://www.aladin.co.kr/shop/wproduct.aspx?ItemId=400907077), [KyoboBook](https://ebook-product.kyobobook.co.kr/dig/epd/ebook/E000013431981), [Yes24](https://www.yes24.com/product/goods/195407357)",
